  "title": "Wind Splits the Crew",
  "brief": "One job is the Pitch Fire that the wind will push onto the Boardwalk, then toward Pitch Hall. The other job is walking two fishers from the far boardwalk. The wind change is the reason you cannot treat this as one pile of work.",
